==Trivia==
*Caliban's Keeper is named after Caliban, a character from the William Shakespeare play ''The Tempest''.
*Caliban's Keeper is the only [[IT Catacombs]] stage whose name has nothing to do with IT.
**This is only true for the English name, as the Japanese name refers to a ''kiriban'', Internet slang for a "good number" (e.g., a good number of hits on a website's hit counter). Since ''kiriban'' and ''Caliban'' sound so similar in Japanese, it may have actually been mistranslated.

